OL,3,GNEWSAApproval for #3m spending on
OL,4,Atheatre revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to upgrade Sheffield's Crucible
OL,7,FTheatre have progressed after South
OL,8,FYorkshire's combined authority approved
OL,9,F#3m for the project.
OL,11,FThe funding forms part of a wider #45m
OL,12,Fscheme to transform the venue and help
OL,13,Fsecure the future of the World Snooker
OL,14,FChampionship in the city, where it has
OL,15,Fbeen held since 1977.
OL,17,FUnder the plans, the main stage
OL,18,Fcapacity will increase from 964 seats
OL,19,Fto 1,500 for the snooker tournament and
OL,20,Fother performances.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
